---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us — Logrus ry"
  description="Logrus ry (Business ID 2040144-2) is a non-profit cultural association founded in 2006 in Helsinki: performing arts, theatre pedagogy, and intercultural dialogue."
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white border-b border-zinc-200 py-12 sm:py-16 text-center">
    <div class="site-container">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-950 mb-3">
        About Us
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium">
        Cultural Non-profit Association Logrus ry (Helsinki)
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-[#fcfbfa]">
    <div class="site-container max-w-5xl">
      <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-10">
        
        <!-- Lead Paragraph -->
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-800 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Logrus ry</strong> is a registered non-profit cultural association (rekisteröity yhdistys, Business ID: 2040144-2), founded in Helsinki in 2006. For 20 years, the association has continuously advanced independent performing arts, theatre pedagogy, and intercultural dialogue across the Helsinki Metropolitan Area.
        </p>

        <!-- Metrics Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-6 bg-[#faf9f7] border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">20 Years</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-snug">of continuous cultural activity in Finland (since 2006)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">25+ Projects</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-snug">theatre productions, creative laboratories, and educational initiatives</div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">15,000+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-snug">audience members and participants across generations</div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-zinc-950 tracking-tight">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-zinc-600 leading-snug">governance transparency and rigorous project accountability</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mission and Priorities -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-950 pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
            Mission & Strategic Priorities
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
            Logrus ry is dedicated to developing an inclusive, open, and safe cultural platform where performing arts serve as a catalyst for social integration, mutual support, intergenerational dialogue, and community building in Finland.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Artistic Quality (Taiteellinen laatu):</strong> Producing and staging contemporary theatrical works in collaboration with professional directors, stage designers, playwrights, and performers.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Low-Threshold Accessibility (Matala kynnys & Saavutettavuus):</strong> Engaging diverse audiences regardless of social background, age, physical ability, or language proficiency.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Integration Through the Arts (Kotoutuminen taiteen keinoin):</strong> Empowering multicultural communities and bridging cultural ties in Finland through collaborative creative expression.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Safer Space Policy (Turvallisemman tilan periaatteet):</strong> Upholding rigorous standards of inclusion, respect, non-discrimination, and dedicated anti-harassment liaison support under our 2026–2028 plan.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Activities -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-950 pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
            Core Activities
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Performing Arts & Theatre Production:</strong> Multilingual, physical, and visual stage performances with Finnish subtitling and universally accessible artistic language. Official theatre portal: <a href="https://www.teatterilogrus.fi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-zinc-950">teatterilogrus.fi</a>.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Arts Education & Regular Workshops:</strong> Acting studios, stage speech, eco-fashion & sustainable costume design, dance/movement workshops, and Finnish language functional learning circles.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-zinc-950 font-bold select-none">—</span>
              <span><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Partnership Programs:</strong> Collaborative productions and initiatives with metropolitan cultural centres (e.g., Caisa, Kanneltalo) and participation in cultural festivals across Finland.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Institutional Transparency -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-950 pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
            Institutional Transparency
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
            The association operates in strict compliance with the Finnish Associations Act (Yhdistyslaki). Core governance documents are openly accessible for partners, auditors, and grant providers:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 pt-2">
            <a
              href="/docs/saannot.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#faf9f7] border border-zinc-200 rounded-md hover:bg-[#f3f1ee] hover:border-zinc-400 transition-all group"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-600 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6zM6 20V4h7v5h5v11H6z"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 group-hover:text-zinc-950">Bylaws of Logrus ry</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold bg-zinc-200 text-zinc-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">PDF</span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="/docs/toimintasuunnitelma.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#faf9f7] border border-zinc-200 rounded-md hover:bg-[#f3f1ee] hover:border-zinc-400 transition-all group"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-600 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6zM6 20V4h7v5h5v11H6z"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 group-hover:text-zinc-950">Action Plan 2027</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold bg-zinc-200 text-zinc-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">PDF</span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="/docs/yhdenvertaisuus.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#faf9f7] border border-zinc-200 rounded-md hover:bg-[#f3f1ee] hover:border-zinc-400 transition-all group"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-600 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6zM6 20V4h7v5h5v11H6z"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 group-hover:text-zinc-950">Equality Plan</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold bg-zinc-200 text-zinc-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">PDF</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Official Registration Details -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-950 pb-3 border-b border-zinc-200">
            Official Registration & Contact Details
          </h2>
          <div class="p-6 bg-[#faf9f7] border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Organization:</strong> Logrus ry (Cultural Association Logrus ry)</p>
            <p><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Business ID (Y-tunnus):</strong> 2040144-2</p>
            <p><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Founded:</strong> 2006</p>
            <p><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Registered Office:</strong> Sibeliuksenkatu 19B, 00250 Helsinki, Finland</p>
            <p><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@logrus.fi" class="underline hover:text-zinc-950">info@logrus.fi</a></p>
            <p><strong class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Theatre Portal:</strong> <a href="https://www.teatterilogrus.fi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-zinc-950">www.teatterilogrus.fi</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
